  allLines:
  - side: 1
    characterName: Linus
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 763ec54e5ebac7a4fab56b7edd48e3bb, type: 3}
    sentence: "Being young and bragging about all the unique experiences you\u2019ve
      had is great, but I think really growing up and then finding out just how unique
      it can all be is better."
    eventTrigger: 
    choices: []
  - side: 0
    characterName: Nemelise
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ef06b996f8fd01a469fcd3724e3ff6bd, type: 3}
    sentence: Then, you really get to see in perspective how different life treats
      each individual person.
    eventTrigger: 
    choices: []
  - side: 1
    characterName: Linus
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    sentence: Well, it seems it treated you pretty well up until now. You are breath-taking.
    eventTrigger: 
    choices: []
  - side: 0
    characterName: Nemelise
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    sentence: "I appreciate it. It wasn\u2019t just life, though. I took care of
      myself.\r\n"
    eventTrigger: 
    choices: []
  - side: 1
    characterName: Linus
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    sentence: "You\u2019ve done a wonderful job, then."
    eventTrigger: StartRitimGame
    choices: []
